WEBVTT

00:02:58.704 --> 00:03:00.663
faster and more efficient.

00:03:00.704 --> 00:03:03.038
Targeted ads are becoming
more personalized,

00:03:03.038 --> 00:03:05.454
corporate content is
becoming more engaging,

00:03:05.496 --> 00:03:08.371
and everything around you
is focusing on spending.

00:03:08.413 --> 00:03:10.038
So let's change that.

00:03:10.038 --> 00:03:13.204
You can reshape your environment
and how you interact with it,

00:03:13.246 --> 00:03:14.871
and I can guide you through it.

00:03:14.871 --> 00:03:16.371
Over the course of this series,

00:03:16.413 --> 00:03:18.829
I'll take you through a step-by-step look

00:03:18.829 --> 00:03:21.579
at how you can change your environment

00:03:21.621 --> 00:03:24.413
and regain control of your finances.

00:03:24.413 --> 00:03:26.079
At the end of every episode,

00:03:26.079 --> 00:03:29.079
I'll share practical tips
based on research

00:03:29.079 --> 00:03:32.829
on how to spend less
and save more today --